I'm not mixing them. Yes, I was talking about {la pa .februari'us.} and it
doesnt work as {lo pa februari}.

And {lo pa februari} makes perfect sense and can be used.
If you use a cmevla with {la} you lose this meaning.

Compare {lo se cmene be lu pa februari'us li'u} vs. {lo pa se cmene be zo
februari'us}.

Sure, {lo pa [MONTH]} hasn't been used before a lot probably since we
rarely have talked about months extensively in Lojban.

